        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daniel wakes up to the same nightmare every night. A girl who will not let him go. When he discovers a missing child report that connects her to his childhood home, he is forced to return to a place filled with unsettling memories and terrifying games he once played with the boy next door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a search for truth quickly becomes a descent into blurred memories and creeping dread. The line between reality and nightmare starts to unravel as Daniel pieces together fragments of the past, unsure if he is solving a case or falling deeper into his own delusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror with a focus on story and atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A haunting narrative filled with mystery, memory, and fear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a childhood home twisted by nightmare logic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover clues through unsettling children’s games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An immersive experience designed to blur the line between dream and reality</p></li></ul>",
